commander","mount_name":"","name":"Master Brother","player_id":1.0,"quality":3.0,"regiment_mode":false,"rule_descriptions":{"Battleborn":"If a unit where most models have this rule is Shaken at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+, it stops being Shaken.","Caster":"Gets X spell tokens at the start of each round, but can’t have more than 6 at once. Once per activation, before attacking, spend as many tokens as the spell’s value to try casting one or more spells (only one try per spell). Pick a target and roll one die, and on 4+ resolve the spell’s effect. Models within 18” of the Caster may spend any number of spell tokens at the same time before rolling to give the Caster +1/-1 to the roll per token.","Defense":"This model gets +X to Defense rolls.","Fearless":"When a unit where most models have this rule fails a Morale Test, roll one die. On a 4+ it counts as passed instead.","Hero":"Heroes with up to Tough(6) may deploy as part of one multi-model unit without another Hero, but must use the unit’s Defense until all other models have been killed. The Hero’s unit, and units within 6” of friendly Heroes with Tough(9) or higher, may use the Hero’s Quality for Morale Tests as long as the Hero isn’t Shaken.","Tough":"This model must take X wounds before being killed. If a model with Tough joins a unit without it, then it is removed last when the unit takes wounds. You must continue to put wounds on the Tough model with most wounds in the unit until it is killed, before starting to put them on the next Tough model (Heroes must be assigned wounds last, even if already wounded)."},"size":1.0,"special_rules":["Hero","Tough(3)","Battleborn","Fearless","Archivist","Caster(2)"]}},{"activation_round":0.0,"casts_current":0.0,"casts_per_round":0.0,"is_activated":false,"is_fatigued":false,"is_shaken":false,"model_positions":[{"position":[-0.38319993019104,0.0,-0.355599999427795],"rotation":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"visible":true},{"position":[-0.343199908733368,0.0,-0.35559999942